{"availability":"available","full":"HIPREL-Group/VeriContest","name":"VeriContest","description":"[NeurIPS 2026 E&D] VeriContest is a large-scale competitive-programming benchmark for verifiable code generation in Rust. It provides expert-validated formal specifications, judge-accepted Rust implementations, Verus-checked proofs, and comprehensive positive and negative test suites.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Rust","stars":13,"forks":6,"created":"2026-05-08T14:23:44Z","updated":"2026-10-16T02:43:40Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://hiprel-group.github.io/VeriContest/","topics":[],"demo":"https://hiprel-group.github.io/VeriContest/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T11:30:14.051Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T11:30:14.051Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T11:30:14.051Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T02:54:27.442Z","stars":12,"forks":6},{"at":"2026-10-09T03:37:57.796Z","stars":12,"forks":6},{"at":"2026-10-12T06:28:16.537Z","stars":13,"forks":6},{"at":"2026-10-18T11:30:14.051Z","stars":13,"forks":6}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["VeriContest is a competitive-programming benchmark for verifiable code generation in Rust with Verus. It accompanies the paper \"VeriContest: A Competitive-Programming Benchmark for Verifiable Code Generation\" (arXiv:2605.08553).","Project website: hiprel-group.github.io/VeriContest.","The current benchmark contains 1,006 problems: 722 from LeetCode and 284 from Codeforces. Each problem pairs a natural-language description with expert-validated formal specifications, judge-accepted Rust code, and Verus-checked proofs. All problems are organized by source platform. Some problems accept multiple feasible answers and require a problem-specific checker instead of comparison with a single expected output."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HIPREL-Group/VeriContest/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"66210d1e5e15c4530f0ebfdb